65,3,1,talk,Minato,,"The candidates are a Workflow Assistant, a Training Studio, a Supplier Data Hub, and a Field Service App. I think the Supplier Data Hub fits everything we discussed.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minato. The Supplier Data Hub avoids the network issues of the Field Service App and doesn't seem to require the constant daily input that May warned us about.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,George,,The Supplier Data Hub is the most prudent choice. It addresses the redundant queries and fits our budget constraints without requiring the frozen capital line.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,May,,"It's the only one that doesn't look like a repeat of our past failures. It's a specific tool for a specific problem, which is exactly what tends to survive here.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I completely agree. The Supplier Data Hub directly addresses the misrouted deliveries and the time wasted copying records, providing a real solution for the people on the floor.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Minato,,I feel very confident in this choice. It helps the staff without adding too much extra work to their already full schedules.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is the most logical path forward. The Field Service App is too risky given the network coverage, and the others don't address the specific inefficiencies we've identified.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,George,,"I concur. It is the only proposal that aligns with our financial reality and the operational gaps we've uncovered. It is a stable, sensible investment.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,May,,"I'm satisfied. It's a targeted solution that doesn't overpromise, which is the best way to ensure it actually gets used and maintained.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm happy that we've found a solution that is both practical and supportive of our colleagues' daily work. I'm ready to vote.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
